# discard is taken, but Bot1 chooses no card: nothing is discarded and nothing is drawn (Swamp stays on the library).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Cool but Rude
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain
Island
Swamp
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
