Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cool but Rude.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose()
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

